eq T_{2}" data-display="0">T_{1}
eq T_{2}</span></li><li><b>B.</b> <span class="math-tex" data-tex="r_{1}
eq r_{2}" data-display="0">r_{1}
eq r_{2}</span>，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="T_{1}
eq T_{2}" data-display="0">T_{1}
eq T_{2}</span></li><li><b>C.</b> <span class="math-tex" data-tex="r_{1}=r_{2}" data-display="0">r_{1}=r_{2}</span>，<span class="math-tex" data-tex="T_{1}=T_{2}" data-display="0">T_{1}=T_{2}</span></li><li><b>D.</b> <span class="math-tex" data-tex="r_{1}
